[{"title":"赠妆春者","author":"吴兆","text":"高台望若仙，出色异人妍。\n南市重围压，东方千骑联。\n衣边浮日彩，髻上惹春烟。\n更恃众怜意，归娇女伴前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1745,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武夷小桃源访刘道人（甲辰暮春，能始、茂之同游）","author":"吴兆","text":"峥嵘入陷石，石径转逾窄。\n划然洞门开，斜光一道白。\n龙湫流暗穴，鸟篆绣苔额。\n穷源有古村，二三避世客。\n避世非避秦，栖心炼精魄。\n春田自耕刈，衣食无需索。\n风动棕花落，雨过药苗摘。\n莺啼林木秀，犬吠暮空碧。\n居然众山中，遂与众山隔。\n坐久恐迷误，归路志前石。\n白云洞口深，似杜重来迹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1746,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"榕城小妓奇奇歌","author":"吴兆","text":"奇奇十二发垂肩，婉伸膝上谁不怜。\n鸦头髻样望如坠，杏子衫新红欲然。\n市门半面窥人惯，门前潮水东西漫。\n阿爷欢喜阿娘娇，东家妒杀西家羡。\n六月南气荔子红，斜柯轻立踏如风。\n八月西风龙眼低，今年攀折与枝齐。\n年纪虽小齿清历，汉语吴歌声的的。\n刘家碧玉未须论，越客明珠应不惜。\n借问春来几树花，双抛桥畔是儿家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1747,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登钓龙台","author":"吴兆","text":"秋色延高台，台荒庙亦冷。\n两三樵牧儿，投石试深井。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1748,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度岭作","author":"吴兆","text":"谷口钟声度岭微，岭头岚气散朝晖。\n江山处处通乡路，只是游人不得归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1749,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿曹能始吴客轩题壁","author":"吴兆","text":"园亭临浦口，门巷暝烟深。\n池岸波新浴，花溪草乍侵。\n云来窗上湿，月过树边阴。\n谁谓留吴客，余将起越吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1750,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归宗寺","author":"吴兆","text":"路绕鸾溪去复回，鹅池闻说右军开。\n山僧相遇衣裳湿，双剑峰头看瀑来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1751,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登五老峰望彭蠡湖歌","author":"吴兆","text":"适度含鄱口，来登五老峰。\n千盘万剥无人迹，雨过泥腥见虎踪。\n一径孤悬五峰背，烟岚五点浓如黛。\n壁面起兮矗相向，石颜叠兮诡万状。\n履触云生处，身齐飞鸟上。\n霞缀屏兮成锦，雾弥谷兮如涨。\n峰头雾雨峰下晴，一边湖树夕阳明。\n波声直撼鄱阳县，江色遥分湖口城。\n忆昔扬帆彭蠡左，湖心迥压看将堕。\n今来顶上看湖光，湖光射眼白如霜。\n不知浮荡苍翠表，只觉微茫众山小。\n林交阴兮青兕啼，草丰茸兮故步迷。\n游人今夜何峰宿，遥逐钟声度水西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1752,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚投黄龙寺慧宗上人房","author":"吴兆","text":"几处禅林聚似村，岭头风雨涧头昏。\n千枝灯影僧初放，一派经声客到门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1753,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"师子岩","author":"吴兆","text":"石罅置檐楹，高低纵复横。\n临深畅幽意，极险尽游情。\n火照潭心影，经传洞腹声。\n际眉岩电射，绕足涧霓生。\n潜怪禅能伏，啼鼯狎不惊。\n欲穷前胜处，无路若为行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1754,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浔阳张侍御宅咏伎","author":"吴兆","text":"房栊花色色，池馆月盈盈。\n古服仍椎髻，新妆忽曼声。\n闻香方觉笑，辨佩即知名。\n上客莫言醉，分歌缓夜情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1755,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送林古度","author":"吴兆","text":"分手寂无语，殷勤独此心。\n梦于游处得，情向别时深。\n庐岳云初起，湓城日半阴。\n孤帆即千里，昨夜在东林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1756,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新秋建安王半隐园应教二首 其一","author":"吴兆","text":"坐望林峦隔，行分岛屿遥。\n蹊崩横卧柳，岸阔接平桥。\n微雨惊雷散，轻炎入树销。\n豫游屏侍从，疏豁似渔樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1757,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新秋建安王半隐园应教二首 其二","author":"吴兆","text":"薄暮登台望，西山翠满栏。\n湖云屯岸宿，松露滴衣寒。\n万井炊烟歇，千家市火残。\n笙歌引前路，花密出犹难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1758,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚登九华山","author":"吴兆","text":"望江亭望晚江晴，飒飒秋兼风水声。\n寺隔数峰犹未到，禅灯几点翠微明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1759,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登天台峰宿（峰离寺二十里，山之最高者）","author":"吴兆","text":"萝磴松崖几百层，猱攀鱼贯始徐登。\n昨朝望处今宵歇，岩下云埋入定僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1760,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别九华山二绝 其一","author":"吴兆","text":"寺前秋净万峰闲，正好寻山又别山。\n谷转溪回留不住，水声相送到人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1761,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别九华山二绝 其二","author":"吴兆","text":"复岭重岩出路赊，渐看龙口有人家。\n行行数里犹回首，秋雪满山荞麦花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1762,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟泊石头城","author":"吴兆","text":"依旧城边明月辉，城中萧索故人稀。\n南游日望东归急，及到金陵不是归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1763,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖春游词七首 其一","author":"吴兆","text":"堤暖百花齐，湖春万柳低。\n管弦初沸日，罗绮已空闺。\n上巳连寒食，车轮间马蹄。\n游人争向处，多在断桥西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1764,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖春游词七首 其二","author":"吴兆","text":"湖水碧粼粼，还疑洧与溱。\n褰裳临翠渚，踏草及芳辰。\n合岸花薰暖，双堤柳夹春。\n今年风景好，直为远游人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1765,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖春游词七首 其三","author":"吴兆","text":"桥外即当垆，楼阴碧树扶。\n水筵移岸酌，越女唱吴歈。\n一径穿孤屿，重光带两湖。\n匝波舟楫动，处处起鸥凫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1766,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖春游词七首 其四","author":"吴兆","text":"越女善拿舟，吴姬解棹讴。\n尊低芳树下，人拥古堤头。\n香酝寻仙客，灵峰问梵流。\n花时无远近，分日出城游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1767,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖春游词七首 其五","author":"吴兆","text":"晴光上柳条，结伴戏花朝。\n歌近舟沿岸，人开马度桥。\n雷峰看塔迥，葛岭弄泉遥。\n日暮争门入，衣香满路飘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1768,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖春游词七首 其六","author":"吴兆","text":"新堤杨柳斜，游冶肯还家。\n珠弹光流月，春衣色胜花。\n幕遮芳草路，骑并美人车。\n何处菱歌起，仍怜似若耶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1769,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖春游词七首 其七","author":"吴兆","text":"游路背湖分，林陬复水濆。\n年传秦代石，人拜宋时坟。\n塔影双峰见，松声九里闻。\n不知天竺近，香气蔼成云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1770,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过吴门访沈野范汭携酒至因赋","author":"吴兆","text":"皋桥通市外，鸿墓即城隈。\n芳躅君能继，衡门客到开。\n药香余石臼，茶绿泛山杯。\n邻圃花迎发，东家酒送来。\n池萍初点絮，阶笋欲穿苔。\n谁复寻行迹，荒蹊不剪莱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1771,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"酬何璧","author":"吴兆","text":"少年为志在仇恩，老大销磨百不存。\n寂寂孤窗风雨夜，因君知我与君言。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1772,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓范汭家过其友卞润甫新居","author":"吴兆","text":"绿树阴相接，过君不出门。\n少年能淡薄，高卧动寒暄。\n开径多邻客，移家只故园。\n晓凉闻汲响，凿井在篱根。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1773,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠王德操居士","author":"吴兆","text":"家在半塘住，常听虎寺钟。\n持斋坐孤馆，礼塔向高峰。\n姓字能藏市，妻儿相赁舂。\n寥寥梁孟后，于尔继芳踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1774,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游天池寺","author":"吴兆","text":"谁家墓道创犹新，便见禅宫迹日陈。\n宝地也闻归别主，青山终是属游人。\n残僧寥落他乡乞，古佛荒凉野魅邻。\n惟有泉声秋可听，苔衣漠漠石磷磷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1775,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送方子公","author":"吴兆","text":"行止因人定，仓皇为计非。\n出门虽异路，贫贱自相依。\n雨湿秋衣薄，风吹病骨微。\n昨宵曾宿别，乡梦亦同归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1776,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟泊天门山寄金陵故旧","author":"吴兆","text":"际晚帆投岸，苍苍暮霭平。\n别愁当月满，乡梦趁潮生。\n牛渚今宵客，鸠兹明日程。\n渐欣江路少，得近故山行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1777,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"到家","author":"吴兆","text":"渡口尚余景，乔木故乡陌。\n谁云客不归，今归转如客。\n村犬吠路隅，室人避门隙。\n入户恍有存，依然旧四壁。\n始归人意新，邻里皆来觌。\n交谴我何言，谁复闵行役。\n兴念及殇儿，生未谙行迹。\n梦寐何由通，徒闻人所惜。\n别时种园树，过墙盈几尺。\n且复息其阴，泪沾衣上碧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1778,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日杂诗","author":"吴兆","text":"新谷望将熟，无田安可希。\n饥驱儿女去，同拾遗穗归。\n鸟雀争喧啄，不忍相逐飞。\n夕舂朝作饭，朝舂夕作糜。\n赖此保朝夕，我心实伤悲。\n爰思古之人，贫贱甘如饴。\n牧豕上林苑，逃耕蒙山陲。\n道胜聊自慰，欣咏《衡门》诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1779,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过汪隐君道会","author":"吴兆","text":"适渡丰溪水，隐隐松明山。\n松色自幽映，溪声复潺湲。\n主人尚高卧，童子启柴关。\n眺听且延伫，落日半林间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1780,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"贫居","author":"吴兆","text":"釜里生鱼甑里尘，非关久雨却关贫。\n床头惟有《梁鸿传》，闲诱荆妻作古人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1781,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闲思寄林古度","author":"吴兆","text":"一与西湖别，春风两度来。\n曾栖山寺里，日日待花开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1782,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早秋斋居","author":"吴兆","text":"早晚凉风至，萧萧闻竹斋。\n今年无客思，又有旧游怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1783,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜郭昭自庐山见过","author":"吴兆","text":"荒村岁暮谁相问，惟有篱花慰索居。\n游过山川常在梦，别来朋旧久无书。\n秋风鸟雀暄禾黍，落日牛羊遍里闾。\n即此萧条空馆夜，与君相对话匡庐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1784,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿吴公励石壁山房","author":"吴兆","text":"山馆雨声秋，秋灯照石楼。\n兴因清景发，宿为故情留。\n往事言难尽，凉风吹不休。\n少年行乐处，多梦秣陵游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1785,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送刘小小为尼","author":"吴兆","text":"罗衣脱却一披缁，却悟红颜有歇时。\n学拜纤纤方礼佛，随班袅袅乍从师。\n忽惊形影灯前异，犹剩繁华梦里知。\n寄语旧家诸姊妹，年年空为落花悲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1786,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄曹学佺","author":"吴兆","text":"几年山水共闲游，无日吟诗不唱酬。\n一卧故园春又暮，楝花零落渐溪头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1787,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"喜雨","author":"吴兆","text":"沛然时雨来，芃芃禾黍起。\n我固无所望，亦为邻里喜。\n晚向西轩眠，溪云满窗几。\n明日钓潭侧，应深几尺水。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1788,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春溪居二绝句 其一","author":"吴兆","text":"门前梧柳长新围，雨暗空林客到稀。\n几欲持竿溪上去，滩头昨夜没渔矶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1789,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春溪居二绝句 其二","author":"吴兆","text":"柳岸沙潭风景多，晚晴新绿映春波。\n渔舠好泊深深处，棹月归来半夜过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1790,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄曹能始","author":"吴兆","text":"闻说官闲心亦闲，马蹄日出不知还。\n落叶满城秋似水，家家楼上有钟山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1791,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春偶过山家","author":"吴兆","text":"山村处处采新茶，一道春流绕几家。\n石径行来微有迹，不知满地是松花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1792,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过吴太常山居 其一","author":"吴兆","text":"只在花深处，恒来亦费寻。\n书声间竹色，鹤梦冷松阴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1793,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过吴太常山居 其一 时过邻僧饭，仍多野客吟","author":"吴兆","text":"冷然暮空碧，清磬出春林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1794,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜自宝应泛舟至秦淮","author":"吴兆","text":"湖月忽来照，萧然水树明。\n棹沿堤影直，星过浦光横。\n家远秋多梦，年丰夜可行。\n前程何处泊，鸡唱是盂城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1795,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"姑苏曲","author":"吴兆","text":"宝带桥边鹊啄花，金阊门外柳藏鸦。\n吴娥卷幔看花笑，十日春晴不在家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1796,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日过冯祭酒孤山别墅","author":"吴兆","text":"池馆青春好，泉台白日辞。\n梅香曾赏处，柳发独攀时。\n湖舫游新主，宾阶生旅葵。\n野烟沉酒径，山月冷歌帷。\n邻起山阳笛，庭间谢傅棋。\n还闻有遗令，开阁散诸姬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1797,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖子夜歌八首 其一","author":"吴兆","text":"湖女二三月，相将戏水涯。\n新堤看杨柳，旧堤看桃花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1798,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖子夜歌八首 其二","author":"吴兆","text":"新着杏红衫，试骑赭白马。\n马骄堤路窄，急为扶侬下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1799,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖子夜歌八首 其三","author":"吴兆","text":"三桥当路半，正好与郎期。\n湖水原无信，郎来那有时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1800,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖子夜歌八首 其四","author":"吴兆","text":"南峰望北峰，如欢又如侬。\n何当云雾合，两峰作一重。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1801,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖子夜歌八首 其五","author":"吴兆","text":"渡头人眼众，船开不敢要。\n惯知侬泊处，不过西泠桥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1802,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖子夜歌八首 其六","author":"吴兆","text":"外湖歌折柳，里湖歌采莲。\n闻声不相及，意绪风中传。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1803,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖子夜歌八首 其七","author":"吴兆","text":"西陵花深处，旧是情人路。\n湖船不出湖，愿欢寻故步。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1804,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖子夜歌八首 其八","author":"吴兆","text":"悔寄孤山梅，悔折断桥柳。\n两地本无情，郎心那得久。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1805,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过西湖怀曹大参学佺","author":"吴兆","text":"每忆同游处，凄然起旧怀。\n兰舟曾泛泛，春鸟正喈喈。\n几访孤山隐，常持净寺斋。\n苦吟花阁晓，泊月柳桥佳。\n此别经三载，闻官进两阶。\n旌骖临蜀道，宾客散秦淮。\n出祖龙江日，嗟余不克偕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1806,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"将之广陵过别林古度留小酌","author":"吴兆","text":"客至摘篱豆，一尊相对吟。\n山光当户冷，秋色入门深。\n即此寒灯夜，兼之远别心。\n明朝广陵道，水岸但枫林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1807,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"禅智寺李本石宗衍同游","author":"吴兆","text":"月明桥畔寺，云是旧隋宫。\n磬发山堂寂，烟销辇路空。\n旅怀深落日，古思入秋风。\n耐可同游在，看碑衰草中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1808,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"法海寺","author":"吴兆","text":"野航时可系，林寺昼犹扃。\n古木无年岁，清阴满户庭。\n客来方礼磬，僧坐但翻经。\n烟起炊茶灶，声闻汲井瓶。\n窗过湖鸟白，檐挂叶虫青。\n蔬饭欣然饱，徐徐步远坰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1809,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和陶饮酒二首 其一","author":"吴梦旸","text":"何悔不学剑，岂云不上书。\n归来坐凉月，绿水周吾庐。\n庭草一以新，知是春风初。\n故人惟故心，独不谓吾疏。\n相向宛夙昔，岂不怀旧都。\n举目盛云物，安能无欢娱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1810,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和陶饮酒二首 其二","author":"吴梦旸","text":"徇名视逐末，锱铢为重轻。\n置身等草木，安得无衰荣。\n华屋歌未阕，白杨闻哭声。\n向平果何意，问死仙如生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1811,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和孝若湖上作","author":"吴梦旸","text":"浩眇湖之阳，信为子所止。\n氛浊一以屏，冲襟净于水。\n凉风四面来，暝色从中起。\n茫茫触无情，情来莫为理。\n宁以终古怀，委之波靡靡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1812,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孝若留饮短歌","author":"吴梦旸","text":"莼洲之上何所为，向君索酒酒勿迟。\n今夜不醉今何时，虚檐烛短风雨苦。\n君属我歌君可舞，座中无言心各许。\n主人胡不进乐方，语及丧乱哀国殇，使我罢酒色不扬，更欲片言追大雅，数十年来谁作者，朱丝无声双泪下。\n君不见吴生轻作万里人，五年三踏长安尘，明朝告别无可陈。\n我道今人贤，将恐君掩耳。\n我道古人贤，不知古人死。\n但愿君家有酒吾且止，眼中依依二三子。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":1813,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]